WEBVTT

00:02:59.204 --> 00:03:01.913
So beautiful, imagine being
greeted like that.

00:03:03.788 --> 00:03:07.454
But what does it take in the way
we see ourselves, our thoughts,

00:03:07.454 --> 00:03:12.579
our emotions and our stories that help us
to thrive in an increasingly complex

00:03:12.579 --> 00:03:16.246
and fraught world? This crucial
question has been at

00:03:16.246 --> 00:03:17.829
the center of my life's work,

00:03:18.496 --> 00:03:21.454
because how we deal with our inner
world drives everything,

00:03:22.246 --> 00:03:27.163
every aspect of how we love, how we live,
how we parent, and how we lead.

00:03:28.371 --> 00:03:31.746
The conventional view of emotions
as good or bad,